  description:
  - Initially being percieved as a hoax, this phenonemon has only recently been proven
    to exist. Many consider this effigy to be a vessel of the Mist incarnate, suggesting
    that the Mist holds some form of etherial power. Further evidence to support
    this claim includes the disappearence of the specimin upon exposure to sunlight,
    leaving behind a few samples of gloomstalk.
  - Throrough examination of the material show no anomalies, retaining distinctive
    properties such as dense stalks and high flamability.
